===
The usual mistake is to write *-uity* for *-acity*, as in:—*Sometimes, however, Dr Bell's perspicuity was at fault./He claims for it superiority to other alternatives, the defects of which he sees with that perspicuity which the advocates of each ideal system invariably display towards rival*
